@@s036 circulation with demands
@@s037 node <i>v</i> with demand <code>dᵥ</code>: super-source <code>s*</code> → those who produce (capacity −dᵥ), those who consume → super-sink <code>t*</code> (capacity dᵥ). A circulation exists if the maximum flow saturates all the arcs of <code>s*</code>
@@s038 lower bounds <code>ℓₑ ≤ f(e)</code>
@@s039 I immediately move <code>ℓₑ</code> on each arc, adjust the demands and look for a circulation with capacity <code>cₑ − ℓₑ</code>
