@@s041 customers and products as in matching, with lower and upper limits on how many questions per customer and per product
@@s042 airline scheduling
@@s043 flights as arcs with lower limit 1 (they must be covered); the planes are the flow
@@s044 image segmentation
@@s045 minimum cut: each pixel is "foreground" or "background"; the arcs pay the wrong probability and the separation between neighbouring pixels
@@s046 project selection
@@s047 see above: positive profits from <code>s</code>, costs towards <code>t</code>, requirements with <code>∞</code>
@@s048 baseball elimination
